        "text": "We’re expanding our AI age-estimation technology globally to place millions more teens in Teen Account protections on Instagram. The post Expanding Teen Account Protections to Teens Around the World appeared first on Meta Newsroom .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/expanding-teen-account-protections-to-teens-around-the-world/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T12:00:45.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-09T20:42:19.239Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E1",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Expanding Teen Account Protections to Teens Around the World",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/expanding-teen-account-protections-to-teens-around-the-world/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T12:00:45.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-09T20:42:19.239Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Today, we’re expanding our AI age-estimation technology globally to place millions more teens in Teen Account protections on Instagram.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/expanding-teen-account-protections-to-teens-around-the-world/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T12:00:45.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-09T20:42:19.239Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "This month, parents in the United States will begin receiving a notification on Instagram explaining how we place teens in age-appropriate protections, and how they can help make sure their teen’s age is accurate.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/expanding-teen-account-protections-to-teens-around-the-world/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T12:00:45.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-09T20:42:19.239Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Teen Accounts on Instagram, Facebook, and Messenger provide teens with a set of built-in protections that automatically limit who can contact them, the content they see, and their time on our apps.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/expanding-teen-account-protections-to-teens-around-the-world/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T12:00:45.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-09T20:42:19.239Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Ensuring all teens receive these protections depends on knowing their age.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/expanding-teen-account-protections-to-teens-around-the-world/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T12:00:45.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-09T20:42:19.239Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "We use AI technology to find people we suspect to be teens, even if they use an adult birthday, and place them in Teen Account protections.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/expanding-teen-account-protections-to-teens-around-the-world/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T12:00:45.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-09T20:42:19.239Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "As a result, millions more teens across the world who use Instagram will receive these built-in protections, even if they’ve misrepresented their age.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/expanding-teen-account-protections-to-teens-around-the-world/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T12:00:45.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-09T20:42:19.239Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "For parents, this means greater peace of mind: no matter where you live, we’re making proactive efforts to place your teen into age-appropriate protections — even if they use an adult birthday to set up an account.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/expanding-teen-account-protections-to-teens-around-the-world/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T12:00:45.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-09T20:42:19.239Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "This expansion builds on our commitments under our recent agreement with 52 bipartisan attorneys general to strengthen how we identify teens and children under 13 on our apps.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/expanding-teen-account-protections-to-teens-around-the-world/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T12:00:45.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-09T20:42:19.239Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The video will link to an article, written by Larry Magid, internet safety advocate and President and CEO of ConnectSafely , detailing our multi-layered age assurance approach, which includes keeping children under 13 off our platforms, providing age appropriate experiences fo…",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/expanding-teen-account-protections-to-teens-around-the-world/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T12:00:45.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-09T20:42:19.239Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Over the years, countries around the world have rapidly introduced new laws governing how to keep teens safe online.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/expanding-teen-account-protections-to-teens-around-the-world/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T12:00:45.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-09T20:42:19.239Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "We’re also strengthening the technology we use to identify accounts that may belong to teens between the ages of 13 and 17 so we can ensure those accounts are placed in experiences designed for teens, even if they give us an adult birthday.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/expanding-teen-account-protections-to-teens-around-the-world/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T12:00:45.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-09T20:42:19.239Z"
      }
    ],
